The arsenal interface (addons/pmc_arsenal/JNA, addons/pmc_arsenal/Common,
addons/pmc_arsenal/Pictures and parts of addons/pmc_arsenal/stringtable.xml)
is derived from "Jeroen (Not) Limited Arsenal" by Jeroen Notenbomer, as
distributed and maintained in Antistasi Ultimate
(https://github.com/Antistasi-Ultimate-Community/A3-Antistasi-Ultimate,
commit 13b692d, folder A3A/addons/jeroen_arsenal and string keys from
A3A/addons/scrt/Stringtable.xml). That code is covered by the following
licences, reproduced verbatim from the Antistasi Ultimate LICENSE file.
The Antistasi garage (APL-ND) and StreetArtist (APL-ND) are NOT included.

